OL,3,GNEWSAOvergrowth cleared to make
OL,4,Astudents feel safer
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn area where university students
OL,7,Fclaimed they felt unsafe because of
OL,8,Fdense overgrowth and concealed banks
OL,9,Fhas been cleaned up.
OL,11,FTeams from the East of England
OL,12,FProbation Service in Northamptonshire
OL,13,Fcleared the former railway line
OL,14,Falongside Beckett Park, in Northampton.
OL,16,FThey also worked with West
OL,17,FNorthamptonshire Council, which said it
OL,18,Fhad improved "public safety" and
OL,19,Fcreated "cleaner, safer spaces for
OL,20,Fresidents, students, visitors and
OL,21,Fwildlife".
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
